{
  "name": "Automation Data Provisioner",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## One-time operator setup\n\nImport this inactive template in the private n8n instance at `n8n.lab.supermorphic.com`, then bind these credentials in the UI:\n\n1. **Automation Data Provisioner** — Postgres credential for `automation_data_control`.\n2. **Automation Data n8n API** — Header Auth credential containing the full-access Community API key in `X-N8N-API-KEY`.\n3. **Automation Data Provisioning Header** — Header Auth credential named `X-Automation-Data-Provisioning` for this private webhook.\n\nBind the Postgres credential to every Postgres node, the API credential to every HTTP Request node, and the webhook credential to **Provisioning Webhook**. Keep execution-data persistence disabled.",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 560
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-760, -760],
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Operator Setup"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "automation-data-provision",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [-720, 0],
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Provisioning Webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $json.body;\nif (!body || typeof body !== 'object' || Array.isArray(body)) throw new Error('invalid_request');\nconst allowedFields = new Set(['domain', 'operation', 'credential']);\nif (Object.keys(body).some((key) => !allowedFields.has(key))) throw new Error('unexpected_request_field');\nconst domain = body.domain;\nconst operation = body.operation;\nconst credential = body.credential;\nif (typeof domain !== 'string' || !/^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,47}$/.test(domain)) throw new Error('invalid_domain');\nif (!['provision', 'reconcile', 'rotate', 'validate'].includes(operation)) throw new Error('invalid_operation');\nif (operation === 'rotate') {\n  if (!['migrator', 'runtime'].includes(credential)) throw new Error('invalid_credential');\n} else if (credential !== undefined) {\n  throw new Error('credential_only_allowed_for_rotation');\n}\nreturn [{ json: { domain, operation, ...(credential ? { credential } : {}) } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-480, 0],
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Normalize Request",
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
